
/*
QUERY NAME: Blackboard Learn User Information and Account Status

PURPOSE:
Retrieves Blackboard Learn user records, including
personal information, system and institution roles,
and account availability and enabled indicators.

DATA SOURCE:
- CDM_LMS.PERSON: Contains Blackboard user information,
  assigned roles, and account status indicators.

FIELDS RETURNED:
- ID: Unique internal person identifier.
- FIRST_NAME: User's first name.
- LAST_NAME: User's last name.
- EMAIL: User's email address.
- SYSTEM_ROLE: Assigned Blackboard system role.
- INSTITUTION_ROLE: Assigned institutional role.
- AVAILABLE_IND: User availability indicator.
- ENABLED_IND: User account enabled indicator.

FILTERING:
- Excludes person records marked as deleted
  using ROW_DELETED_TIME IS NULL.
- Includes available and unavailable users.
- Includes enabled and disabled users.
- No specific system or institution roles are excluded.

SORTING:
- No ORDER BY clause is specified.
- Results are not guaranteed to appear in any
  particular order.

NOTES:
- The query returns all nondeleted person records.
- AVAILABLE_IND and ENABLED_IND are displayed
  but are not used to restrict the results.
- A nondeleted user is not necessarily an active user.
- The query does not check course enrollments,
  login activity, or account creation dates.
*/

SELECT
    p.ID,
    p.FIRST_NAME,
    p.LAST_NAME,
    p.EMAIL,
    p.SYSTEM_ROLE,
    p.INSTITUTION_ROLE,
    p.AVAILABLE_IND,
    p.ENABLED_IND
FROM CDM_LMS.PERSON p
WHERE p.ROW_DELETED_TIME IS NULL;
